{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>IN THIS DEMO</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Experience the opening of <i>Psycho-Kin</i> with <strong>five handpicked levels from Chapter 1</strong>, introducing the game\u2019s unique mix of puzzle planning and fast-paced action. Along the way, you\u2019ll watch <strong>story cutscenes that introduce Richard, Jack, and the shadows of their past</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4069770/extras/8448f85d4a75e329950702d2a4a6469e.poster.avif?t=1760665973\" width=440 height=128 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4069770/extras/8448f85d4a75e329950702d2a4a6469e.webm?t=1760665973\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><i>Psycho-Kin</i> is a <strong>uber-stylized, top-down tactical shooter</strong> set in an <strong>alternate-history Cold War</strong>. <strong>Swap between two linked characters</strong> to outwit enemies in <strong>tense, strategic combat</strong>, while unravelling a <strong>deep, psychological story</strong> of espionage, trauma, and redemption.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4069770/extras/12a58516cf2d333371a31b89d22059eb.poster.avif?t=1760665973\" width=800 height=272 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4069770/extras/12a58516cf2d333371a31b89d22059eb.webm?t=1760665973\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4069770/extras/12a58516cf2d333371a31b89d22059eb.mp4?t=1760665973\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4069770/extras/e73a44824cb3355470127fb4c8ad8b54.poster.avif?t=1760665973\" width=285 height=99 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4069770/extras/e73a44824cb3355470127fb4c8ad8b54.webm?t=1760665973\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4069770/extras/4f5640722ad0da9f1db08c1fbdf368a9.poster.avif?t=1760665973\" width=800 height=258 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4069770/extras/4f5640722ad0da9f1db08c1fbdf368a9.webm?t=1760665973\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4069770/extras/4f5640722ad0da9f1db08c1fbdf368a9.mp4?t=1760665973\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><i>Psycho-Kin</i> is a <strong>top-down shooter</strong> where you control two characters, <strong>switching between them by eliminating enemies strategically placed throughout the map</strong>. Each foe is <strong>linked to vital elements like doors</strong>, blocking access to key areas. <strong>Plan your kills wisely</strong> to navigate the intricate web of connections and unlock every corner of the stage. <strong>Utilize the map overview mode</strong> to visualize the links between enemies and doors, allowing you to plan your moves carefully.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4069770/extras/084b38e281e53b2c2f524fadaf35ae63.poster.avif?t=1760665973\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4069770/extras/084b38e281e53b2c2f524fadaf35ae63.webm?t=1760665973\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4069770/extras/084b38e281e53b2c2f524fadaf35ae63.mp4?t=1760665973\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4069770/extras/0f278fe47f21e3547689dede25bab64d.poster.avif?t=1760665973\" width=198 height=86 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4069770/extras/0f278fe47f21e3547689dede25bab64d.webm?t=1760665973\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4069770/extras/dbaf4247244e9bf3da8fe2dca2a193f2.poster.avif?t=1760665973\" width=800 height=252 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4069770/extras/dbaf4247244e9bf3da8fe2dca2a193f2.webm?t=1760665973\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4069770/extras/dbaf4247244e9bf3da8fe2dca2a193f2.mp4?t=1760665973\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Set in <strong>1983</strong>, during an <strong>alternate Cold War where the nuclear bomb was never invented</strong>, <i>Psycho-Kin</i> follows <strong>Richard</strong>, a <strong>former member of an elite psychic unit</strong> created to gain the upper hand in a brutal arms race between the U.S. and Russia. Now retired, Richard is <strong>haunted by relentless nightmares</strong> and attends therapy with <strong>Rachel, a sharp and quick-witted therapist</strong> who pushes him to confront his buried past. Through their sessions, he <strong>relives harrowing missions alongside his hot-headed partner Jack</strong>, uncovering <strong>buried secrets and the true cost of his abilities</strong> as he struggles to confront his demons and escape the <strong>shadow of his former life</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4069770/extras/3077bd0b5988c79b2524858103b436fa.poster.avif?t=1760665973\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4069770/extras/3077bd0b5988c79b2524858103b436fa.webm?t=1760665973\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4069770/extras/3077bd0b5988c79b2524858103b436fa.mp4?t=1760665973\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4069770?t=1760665973","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4069770?t=1760665973","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4069770/84aba2eae45cf3e0b50ee8c846cb3011cd17a972/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1760665973","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4069770/84aba2eae45cf3e0b50ee8c846cb3011cd17a972/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1760665973","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Game demo","id":10},{"description":"Camera Comfort","id":67},{"description":"Color Alternatives","id":66},{"description":"Subtitle Options","id":65}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[5],"notes":"Psycho-Kin Demo contains graphic violence and strong language."},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>IN THIS DEMO</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Experience the opening of <i>Psycho-Kin</i> with <strong>five handpicked levels from Chapter 1</strong>, introducing the game\u2019s unique mix of puzzle planning and fast-paced action. Along the way, you\u2019ll watch <strong>story cutscenes that introduce Richard, Jack, and the shadows of their past</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" post